{
  "format": "wire3-fixture/1",
  "about": "Strict decoding of a wire-3 JSON request (core CORE-E7), on POST /relay/poll signed as a registered agent: a member the route does not take, a member given twice, a member spelled in another case, a value of the wrong type, null, or data after the JSON value is 400 bad_request naming the member; a well-formed body, or none, is served.",
  "setup": "hub",
  "cases": [
